From: Jesus David Saavedra Latorre <iam.jesusd88@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 9 Oct 2026 22:49:44 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 10/26] feat(digitizer): add two finger flick for back and
 forward

A fast, mostly horizontal two finger flick outside the edge zones taps
DIGITIZER_FLICK_RIGHT_KC or DIGITIZER_FLICK_LEFT_KC once and locks the
gesture until the fingers lift. Horizontal scroll is held for up to
DIGITIZER_FLICK_TIMEOUT and then flushed without loss; vertical scroll,
pinch and edge swipes are unchanged. Opt-in via DIGITIZER_MOUSE_FLICK_ENABLE,
enabled in the Dilemma mac keymap.
